00:25:34.418 --> 00:25:36.090
- 100%.

00:25:36.090 --> 00:25:38.505
- [Female] How much time
does consumer spend time

00:25:38.505 --> 00:25:41.152
with Facebook, do you
have a figure on that?

00:25:41.152 --> 00:25:43.277
- No, I don't know what
the updated figure is,

00:25:43.277 --> 00:25:47.433
but here's what I can
tell you, over 50% of time

00:25:47.433 --> 00:25:50.257
spent on a mobile device
in the world is being

00:25:50.257 --> 00:25:53.552
spent on a social network,
and Facebook has a

00:25:53.552 --> 00:25:55.223
disproportionate amount of that time, so,

00:25:55.223 --> 00:25:57.640
just ungodly hours and hours.

00:25:58.486 --> 00:26:02.166
Today, as we record this,
if you add up the attention,

00:26:02.166 --> 00:26:05.440
time, that is spent in
Facebook and Instagram

00:26:05.440 --> 00:26:09.968
