the power of that tool.

00:26:09.968 --> 00:26:12.546
- [Female] How much
power does podcasts have?

00:26:12.546 --> 00:26:16.129
- A lot, I think audio
is the next frontier

00:26:17.236 --> 00:26:19.082
because it's passive consumption,

00:26:19.082 --> 00:26:21.195
and time is very important.

00:26:21.195 --> 00:26:24.736
So I'm very bullish on
podcasts, I'm very bullish

00:26:24.736 --> 00:26:28.903
on Alexa and Google Home
and devices that interact

00:26:29.798 --> 00:26:32.375
with you through voice.

00:26:32.375 --> 00:26:35.185
I'm betting the farm on voice
being the next frontier.

00:26:35.185 --> 00:26:37.263
- [Female] Wow.

00:26:37.263 --> 00:26:38.930
Who's inspiring you?

00:26:41.710 --> 00:26:44.287
