00:28:42.721 --> 00:28:44.230
And I like the challenge.

00:28:44.230 --> 00:28:45.897
I like the pressure.

00:28:47.249 --> 00:28:49.002
It's what I'm comfortable with.

00:28:49.002 --> 00:28:50.169
It's who I am,

00:28:51.567 --> 00:28:54.516
- [Female] Gary, you should
